      "content": "That makes sense. When you say Drill and some of the TikTok slang have \"urban or street connotations,\" can you expand on that? Specifically, from a marketing perspective, why would those be seen as less \"sophisticated\" compared to something like indie folk or even Reggaeton? Like, is it just the energy, or is there a specific social profile/class level you're associating with those \"street\" terms?",
